{"translation":{"id":"cmn_cbs","name":"Biblica® 圣经当代译本开放资源","website":"https://ebible.org/Scriptures/details.php?id=cmncbs","licenseUrl":"https://ebible.org/Scriptures/details.php?id=cmncbs","licenseNotes":null,"shortName":"CBS","englishName":"Mandarin Chinese Open Contemporary Bible (Simplified)","language":"cmn","textDirection":"ltr","sha256":"74bf453a33641322ae4ddd23e051ee64d1412722972e541371ef97308285fe7d","availableFormats":["json"],"listOfBooksApiLink":"/api/cmn_cbs/books.json","numberOfBooks":66,"totalNumberOfChapters":1189,"totalNumberOfVerses":30961,"languageName":"中文","languageEnglishName":"Chinese"},"book":{"id":"1CO","translationId":"cmn_cbs","name":"哥林多前书","commonName":"哥林多前书","title":"哥林多前书","order":46,"numberOfChapters":16,"sha256":"3ea536a95e4975b8ebe77976cde16baab162baac7648d81845fd421e8b0ad812","firstChapterNumber":1,"firstChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cbs/1CO/1.json","lastChapterNumber":16,"lastChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cbs/1CO/16.json","totalNumberOfVerses":437},"chapter":{"number":13,"content":[{"type":"heading","content":["爱的真谛"]},{"type":"verse","number":1,"content":["我就算能说人类和天使的各种语言，如果没有爱，也不过是咣咣作响的锣和钹。"]},{"type":"verse","number":2,"content":["我就算能做先知讲道，又明白各种奥秘，而且知识渊博，甚至有移开山岭的信心，如果没有爱，也一无是处。"]},{"type":"verse","number":3,"content":["我就算倾家荡产周济穷人，甚至舍己捐躯任人焚烧",{"noteId":16},"，如果没有爱，也一无所获。"]},{"type":"verse","number":4,"content":["爱是恒久忍耐，又有恩慈；爱是不嫉妒，不自吹自擂，不骄傲自大，"]},{"type":"verse","number":5,"content":["不鲁莽无礼，不自私自利，不轻易动怒，不怀怨记恨，"]},{"type":"verse","number":6,"content":["不喜爱不义，只喜爱真理；"]},{"type":"verse","number":7,"content":["凡事能包容，凡事有信心，凡事有盼望，凡事能忍耐。"]},{"type":"verse","number":8,"content":["爱永不止息。然而，先知讲道的恩赐终会过去，说方言的恩赐也会停止，知识也将成为过去。"]},{"type":"verse","number":9,"content":["我们现在知道的有限，做先知所讲的也有限，"]},{"type":"verse","number":10,"content":["等那全备的来到，这有限的事都要被废弃。"]},{"type":"verse","number":11,"content":["当我是小孩子的时候，我的思想、言语和推理都像小孩子，长大后，我就把一切幼稚的事丢弃了。"]},{"type":"verse","number":12,"content":["如今我们好像对着镜子观看影像，模糊不清，但将来会面对面。现在我所知道的有限，但将来会完全知道，如同主知道我一样。"]},{"type":"verse","number":13,"content":["如今常存的有信、望、爱这三样，其中最伟大的是爱。"]}],"footnotes":[{"noteId":16,"caller":"+","text":"“舍己捐躯任人焚烧”有古卷作“为了夸口而舍己捐躯”。","reference":{"chapter":13,"verse":3}}]},"thisChapterLink":"/api/cmn_cbs/1CO/13.json","thisChapterAudioLinks":{},"nextChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cbs/1CO/14.json","nextChapterAudioLinks":{},"previousChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cbs/1CO/12.json","previousChapterAudioLinks":{},"numberOfVerses":13}